{"title":"죽은 영웅들의 싸움 -이로마키아-","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:LABXfXX1NfsF0rTYHTKd","sourceHash":"cd9c826a52365198f06362bfae61dbc75d4a283d76c47b00e78bc7bbe5bdc320","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":6866240,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.99,"end":4.41,"text":"「死を招く 紫水晶の瞳","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.41,"end":6.53,"text":"あの者と戦ってはなりません」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":6.53,"end":8.87,"text":"「何故です、母上」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":8.87,"end":11.35,"text":"「あなたは 平凡な生より","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":11.35,"end":14.02,"text":"英雄としての 死を望むというですか？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":14.02,"end":19.62,"text":"「母上、死すべき者達が、私を待ってるのです」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":19.62,"end":22.48,"text":"「いかないでおくれ！あの者は」「ハッ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":22.48,"end":27.49,"text":"「レオン！嗚呼 レオンティウス！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":27.49,"end":31.3,"text":"「アメティストス将軍に続けぇ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":31.3,"end":34.73,"text":"【歴史は駈け廻る】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":34.73,"end":39.06,"text":"「小雨がちらちらと 煩わしいですね」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":39.06,"end":42.26,"text":"「安全圏からしか撃てぬ 腰抜けどもめ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":42.26,"end":44.59,"text":"「弓兵は 相手にせずとも良い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":44.59,"end":48.32,"text":"オリオン亡き 今、奴らはただの雑魚に過ぎん」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":48.32,"end":51.48,"text":"「閣下、敵の指揮官はどうやら」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":51.48,"end":54.78,"text":"「猪突猛進しか知らん バカのようですね」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":54.78,"end":57.16,"text":"「シリウス！お前の部隊は左！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":57.16,"end":65.93,"text":"オルフ！お前の部隊は右から廻れ、挟撃するぞ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":65.93,"end":68.93,"text":"不死なる者が 薙ぎ払う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":68.93,"end":72.25,"text":"紅い緋い 死の渚","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":72.25,"end":75.27,"text":"今は 物言わぬ屍","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":75.27,"end":78.35,"text":"彼等にも 物語があった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":78.35,"end":81.99,"text":"されど ささやかな ささやかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":81.99,"end":84.98,"text":"希望(みらい)さえ 希望(みらい)さえ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":84.98,"end":88.23,"text":"運命は ミラは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":88.23,"end":91.46000000000001,"text":"赦さなかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":91.46000000000001,"end":94.6,"text":"変わり果てた 彼等に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":94.6,"end":97.47,"text":"接吻(くちづけ)する者は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":97.47,"end":101.08,"text":"愛する 恋人(ひと)ではなく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":101.08,"end":104.31,"text":"飢えた 禿鷹のみ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":104.31,"end":105.87,"text":"冥界の剣エレフセウス (ハデス クシフォス エレフセウス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":105.87,"end":109.1,"text":"死を与える死神 (ホゥトン フォボス セ サナトス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":109.1,"end":112.45,"text":"一匹狼エレフセウス (モノス リコス エレフセウス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":112.45,"end":115.64,"text":"同胞に死をもたらす (フォルテ ヘレネス ヤ タナトス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":115.64,"end":118.75,"text":"「久しいな、イーリオンよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":118.75,"end":121.97,"text":"我等、忘れはしまいぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":121.97,"end":123.77,"text":"お前を守る楯が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":123.77,"end":126.64,"text":"誰の血によって 築かれた物かをなぁ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":126.64,"end":142.87,"text":"「将軍閣下ー！」「突撃ぃぃぃぃっ！！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":142.87,"end":145.87,"text":"「陛下！イーリオンが落ちました！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":145.87,"end":147.88,"text":"「何！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":147.88,"end":152.03,"text":"「件のアメティストス率いる、奴隷部隊の仕業のようです！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":152.03,"end":156.63,"text":"「馬鹿な、アネモスの加護篤き、あの城壁を」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":156.63,"end":161.98,"text":"「アネモスの軍属、英雄イーリアスをも討ち倒す程の武勇！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":161.98,"end":166.56,"text":"奴もまた陛下と同じく、神の眷属なのやも知れませんぞ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":166.56,"end":173.02,"text":"レグルスは 東夷(バルバロイ)に 備えろ 「はっ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":173.02,"end":179.37,"text":"ゾスマは 北狄(アマゾン)に 備えろ 「はっ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":179.37,"end":185.82,"text":"カストルは 聖都(イリオン)へ 供を 「はっ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":185.82,"end":188.56,"text":"我等 【雷神に連なる者】 (アルカディオス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":188.56,"end":192.3,"text":"皆 生きて また逢おうぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":192.3,"end":195.37,"text":"『運命は 残酷だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":195.37,"end":198.63,"text":"されど 彼女を怖れるな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":198.63,"end":201.76,"text":"女神(ミラ)が 戦わぬ者に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":201.76,"end":204.86,"text":"微笑むことなど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":204.86,"end":206.61,"text":"決して ないのだから』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":206.61,"end":209.59,"text":"『人間(ひと)は 皆 何時(いつ)までも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":209.59,"end":212.82999999999998,"text":"無力な奴隷ではない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":212.82999999999998,"end":216.12,"text":"戦うのだ 気紛れな 運命(神)と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":216.12,"end":220.87,"text":"未来を 取り戻す為』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":220.87,"end":224.92000000000002,"text":"The paths of the two beasts have crossed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":224.92000000000002,"end":226.93,"text":"「奴がアルカディアの 勇者デミトリウスが仔」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":226.93,"end":228.04,"text":"「憎き地の国王 レオンティウス！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":228.04,"end":229.82999999999998,"text":"「ミーシャの仇！私が相手になろう！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":229.82999999999998,"end":230.99,"text":"「望むところだぁ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":230.99,"end":233.79,"text":"奪い合う 時代(とき)の覇権","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":233.79,"end":236.49,"text":"永遠(とわ)なる 調べよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":236.49,"end":238.56,"text":"駈け廻る 趨勢(すうせい)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":238.56,"end":240.26,"text":"生命(せい)は 流星","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":240.26,"end":242.93,"text":"刹那の 煌(きらめき)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":242.93,"end":246.44,"text":"死せる者達が 駆け抜ける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":246.44,"end":249.44,"text":"神話の時代よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":249.44,"end":251.12,"text":"屠り合う 英雄","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":251.12,"end":252.97,"text":"死して 冥友(めいゆう)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":252.97,"end":256.78,"text":"去り逝く 運命(さだめ) (レオンティウス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":256.78,"end":260.1,"text":"「アメティストス。 へレーネスのお前が何故","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":260.1,"end":262.94,"text":"バルバロイの侵略に加担するのだ！」(エレフセウス)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":262.94,"end":265.2,"text":"「祖国が私に何をしてくれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":265.2,"end":267.87,"text":"愛する者を奪っただけではないか！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":267.87,"end":269.36,"text":"嗤わせるな！やぁっ」「おやめなさい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":269.36,"end":280.97,"text":"「は、母上っ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":280.97,"end":290.78,"text":"「レオン エレフ おやめなさい、っぁ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":290.78,"end":297.73,"text":"「母上っ、ミラよ！うっ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":297.73,"end":300.9,"text":"「私を置いて逝くな！許さんぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":300.9,"end":309.03,"text":"レオンティウス！うっ！ぐっ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}